# The screensaver engine (examples/somnium/, docs/design/somnium.md), somnium 0:
# the plasma. The request asks for frames 37 and 38 of seed 0x0BADCAFE with
# praetermitte = 37, so this also pins that skipping frames of a stateless
# somnium lands on the same t as rendering them would. 96,000 bytes: two
# 160x100 rgb24 frames, no header.
# 
# The golden is expected.out, written by the INDEPENDENT oracle
# prototypes/somnium_oracle.py, which mirrors the program's integer
# operation order. All-integer, so there is no rounding mode to agree on: a
# differing byte means one side changed a formula or the order of its draws.
# (No stdout= on purpose: expected.out IS the reference.)
TEST: expect-exit=0 sources=examples/somnium/somnium.exsc,examples/somnium/plasma.exsc,examples/somnium/ignis.exsc,examples/somnium/vita.exsc,examples/somnium/pluvia.exsc,examples/somnium/stellae.exsc,examples/somnium/cuniculus.exsc,examples/somnium/abyssus.exsc,examples/somnium/titulus.exsc,examples/signaculum/forma.exsc,examples/somnium/signum.exsc,examples/somnium/fulmen.exsc,examples/somnium/cruor.exsc,examples/somnium/pyramis.exsc,examples/somnium/machina.exsc stdin=tests/data/somnium_plasma.bin
